6T13:32:12Z","value":53,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4859720","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4200110-1847286114033090","game_id":"steam-4200110","kind":"announcement","title":"Nekome: Nazi Hunter - Meet Hitler's Hyenas","summary":"Today we're introducing some of the monsters Vano will cross paths with in Nekome - Hitler's Hyenas. They're some of the regime's most vicious officers and enforcers, each notorious for their cruelty and each presenting Vano with a very different kind of problem. Watch the latest Nekome Dev Log below to find out, or if you prefer the written word - we've got you covered. Read on for the full Dev Log.Who are Hitler's Hyenas? The Hyenas aren't a formal unit. They're a collection of Nazi officers a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:05:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033090","verified_at":"2026-10-22T20:27:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4200110-1846651706691606","game_id":"steam-4200110","kind":"announcement","title":"The Nekome Demo is LIVE NOW 🔪","summary":"You’ve watched Vano stab, punch, shoot and generally make life very unpleasant for Nazis - Now it’s your turn!The Nekome: Nazi Hunter demo is officially LIVE NOW on Steam during Steam Next Fest, October 19 – 26. The demo gives you an early taste of Horde of the Reich, an extra game mode coming to Nekome that puts your combat skills to the test across 25 increasingly challenging stages. What can you do in the demo? 🔪 Survive 25 stages of increasingly challenging combat 🥷 Go stealthy and take enem","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:09:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691606","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4200110-1846651706683007","game_id":"steam-4200110","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the Nekome Demo During Steam Next Fest","summary":"Next week, you’ll be able to get your hands on Horde of the Reich, an extra game mode coming to Nekome: Nazi Hunter, with a free demo during Steam Next Fest.Your job is simple: survive 25 increasingly brutal stages and set the highest score you can.Go quiet. Get into a brawl. Steal a gun. Grab whatever you can find and use it as a weapon, or just keep stabbing...that works too!Horde of the Reich includes:25 stages of increasingly challenging combatStealth, brawling and gunplayNew skills to unloc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T20:24:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683007","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4200110-1842212951296833","game_id":"steam-4200110","kind":"announcement","title":"Nekome Dev Log #2 - One target, many ways in.​","summary":"Hello everyone and welcome to the second Dev Log for Nekome: Nazi Hunter! In Log #1 we introduced you to Vano Nastasu, a Romani survivor hunting the monsters responsible for murdering his family. From the trailers and gameplay we’ve released, you know that you’ll be cutting a bloody path through the game - but there are multiple ways to achieve your goals! In today’s Dev Log we’ll be checking them out.If you prefer your Dev Logs in video form, please check out the link below:As an indie studio, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T13:00:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296833","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4200110-1835236783557890","game_id":"steam-4200110","kind":"announcement","title":"The Hunt Begins - Nekome Dev Log #1","summary":"Hey everyone, If you caught the new trailer today, thank you for being here. We’ve got a lot more to share in the months ahead, and this is where we’ll be sharing it. For anyone discovering Nekome for the first time: Nekome: Nazi Hunter is a brutal third-person action game following Vano Nastasu, a Romani survivor hunting the people responsible for destroying his family. Stealth, close-quarters combat, and raw violence all play a role as Vano carves a path through enemy territory in search of re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-10T15:13:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783557890","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4200110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:01Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:00Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4200110":"2026-10-26T11:45:01Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4200110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:00Z"},"4859720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:45:01Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4200110","app_id":4200110,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:29Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1d51f502d89aab48a40ca4ab120c0bcf9bb4d3e10d90